      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your desire to accept the inevitable is a response to the deep fatigue that comes from feeling powerless, and acknowledging the pain of that conclusion is completely valid. While some find solace in letting go, most people discover that choosing to act with kindness or protect those they love can actually change the nature of the ending rather than just accepting a fixed outcome. If the weight of this certainty is making it impossible for you to stay alive or function normally, please reach out to a mental health professional who can help you navigate this despair safely. There is no mercy in surrendering without your personal help and understanding, and you deserve support even when the world feels broken.",
